title: Checkmk Capability Database
agents: linux, windows
catalog: app/checkmk
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Reports statistics about the persistent Capability Database that the
 "Checkmk Monitoring Compliance" check maintains: the file size, the total
 number of entries, the number of entries per capability type, how many
 capabilities are monitorable and how many are monitored, the number of
 distinct hosts and tokens, and the time of the last update.

 The data is read server-side by the special agent. Enable "Report capability
 database statistics" in the "Checkmk Monitoring Compliance" special-agent
 rule on exactly one host (for example the Checkmk server host) so that a
 single instance of this service is created.

 By default the service is {OK}. It reports {WARN} (configurable) when the
 database file does not exist yet, and optionally {WARN}/{CRIT} when the
 database has not been updated within a configurable time span.

 Metrics: capability_db_entries, capability_db_size, capability_db_monitorable,
 capability_db_monitored, capability_db_hosts.

item:
 No item. There is one service per reporting host.

discovery:
 One service "Checkmk Capability Database" is created when the special agent
 emits the statistics section.
